{"document":"## Existing context\nThis is a TypeScript ESM project with `bun test` as the test script in `package.json`. `src/checkout.ts` currently imports `execSync` from `node:child_process` and interpolates `userAgent` into a shell command. `test/checkout.test.ts` imports `healthProbe` from `../src/checkout` and asserts `healthProbe(\"$(id)\")` must not execute shell metacharacters.\n\n## ADR-001: No cross-cutting decisions needed\n**Status:** Accepted\n**Context:** The goal is a small focused edit localized to `src/checkout.ts`; repository conventions show no new API, schema, feature surface, or dependency choice is needed.\n**Decision:** This goal is trivial; no cross-cutting decisions are needed. Replace the vulnerable shell-string execution in `src/checkout.ts` with the existing Node child_process argument-array pattern using `execFile` or `spawn`, preserve the exported `healthProbe(userAgent: string): string` signature and returned UTF-8 string behavior, do not modify `test/checkout.test.ts`, and do not add dependencies.\n**Consequences:** None of note beyond ensuring `bun test` passes and no request-header interpolation into shell strings remains under `src/`.\n\n```baro-obligations-v1\n{\"schemaVersion\":1,\"obligations\":[{\"id\":\"O-001\",\"invariantIds\":[\"G-A1\"],\"subject\":\"project test suite boundary\",\"scenario\":\"after the src/checkout.ts shell-injection fix is applied\",\"expectedOutcome\":\"the Bun test suite completes successfully\",\"evidence\":[\"bun test\"]},{\"id\":\"O-002\",\"invariantIds\":[\"G-A2\"],\"subject\":\"src request-header command execution boundary\",\"scenario\":\"any request header-derived value is used by code under src/\",\"expectedOutcome\":\"no request header value is interpolated into a shell command string anywhere under src/\",\"evidence\":[\"rg -n \\\"`[^`]*(userAgent|User-Agent|headers?|request)[^`]*`|execSync\\\\(|exec\\\\(\\\" src/\"]},{\"id\":\"O-003\",\"invariantIds\":[\"G-A3\"],\"subject\":\"src/checkout.ts healthProbe child_process boundary\",\"scenario\":\"healthProbe receives any User-Agent string for the existing problematic probe call\",\"expectedOutcome\":\"the child process is invoked with execFile/spawn and an argument array, not a shell command string containing the User-Agent\",\"evidence\":[\"Inspect src/checkout.ts for execFile/spawn usage with command plus args array at the healthProbe call site.\"]},{\"id\":\"O-004\",\"invariantIds\":[\"G-C1\"],\"subject\":\"test/checkout.test.ts file boundary\",\"scenario\":\"after the security fix is applied\",\"expectedOutcome\":\"test/checkout.test.ts is byte-for-byte unchanged\",\"evidence\":[\"git diff --exit-code -- test/checkout.test.ts\"]},{\"id\":\"O-005\",\"invariantIds\":[\"G-C2\"],\"subject\":\"package dependency manifest boundary\",\"scenario\":\"after replacing shell-string execution with child_process argument-array usage\",\"expectedOutcome\":\"no dependency manifest or lockfile contains added dependencies\",\"evidence\":[\"git diff --exit-code -- package.json bun.lockb bun.lock package-lock.json yarn.lock pnpm-lock.yaml\"]},{\"id\":\"O-006\",\"invariantIds\":[\"G-C3\"],\"subject\":\"src child_process invocation boundary\",\"scenario\":\"healthProbe receives a User-Agent containing shell metacharacters such as $(id)\",\"expectedOutcome\":\"the User-Agent is passed only as a child_process argument value and is never interpolated into a shell command string under src/\",\"evidence\":[\"grep -R \\\"execSync\\\\|exec(\\\\|\\\\${.*userAgent\\\\|userAgent.*`\\\" src/ && exit 1 || true\"]},{\"id\":\"O-007\",\"invariantIds\":[\"G-C4\"],\"subject\":\"src/checkout.ts healthProbe child_process boundary\",\"scenario\":\"When healthProbe receives a User-Agent containing shell metacharacters\",\"expectedOutcome\":\"The User-Agent is passed via an execFile/spawn argument array, with no shell-string interpolation and no WAF-style filtering used as the fix.\",\"evidence\":[\"Review src/checkout.ts and confirm child_process is invoked with execFile/spawn argv array and no interpolated shell command containing userAgent.\"]},{\"id\":\"O-008\",\"invariantIds\":[\"G-C5\"],\"subject\":\"change delivery boundary\",\"scenario\":\"When the fix is ready for review\",\"expectedOutcome\":\"A pull request is opened with base branch main and remains unmerged.\",\"evidence\":[\"gh pr view --json baseRefName,state,mergedAt confirms baseRefName is main and mergedAt is null.\"]}]}\n```\n\n```baro-constraints-v1\n{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\n  \"predicates\": [\n    {\n      \"invariantId\": \"G-C1\",\n      \"kind\": \"unchanged\",\n      \"pathPrefix\": \"\",\n      \"pathSuffix\": \"test/checkout.test.ts\",\n      \"text\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ts":"2026-10-31T09:32:25.480Z","type":"decision_document"}
